+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+  <meta charset="utf-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
+  <title>Marginalia Books, an independent bookshop in Little Hadley</title>
+  <link rel="icon" href="data:,">
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/styles.css">
+</head>
+<body>
+  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to main content</a>
+
+  <header class="site-header">
+    <div class="site-header-inner">
+      <p class="brand"><a href="index.html">Marginalia Books</a></p>
+      <nav aria-label="Main">
+        <ul class="nav-list">
+          <li><a href="index.html" aria-current="page">Home</a></li>
+          <li><a href="books.html">Books</a></li>
+          <li><a href="events.html">Events</a></li>
+          <li><a href="visit.html">Visit</a></li>
+        </ul>
+      </nav>
+    </div>
+  </header>
+
+  <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
+    <div class="hero">
+      <h1>Welcome to Marginalia Books</h1>
+      <p>Marginalia is an independent bookshop on Lantern Row in Little Hadley. We have sold books to the same neighbourhood since 1987, and the shelves reflect the people who run them: six booksellers who read everything we stock before it goes on the table.</p>
+      <p>Come in for a long browse, a recommendation you did not know you needed, or a quiet corner with a cup of tea. Our range is small and deliberate, with a particular love for crime, poetry and the kind of nature writing that makes you want to put your boots on.</p>
+    </div>
+
+    <section>
+      <h2>Staff picks</h2>
+      <p>Three books the team has been pressing on customers this autumn. Each one has a card pinned beside the till, written by the bookseller who loved it most.</p>
+      <ul id="staff-picks" class="card-list"></ul>
+      <p><a href="books.html">Browse the full catalog</a> to see every title we stock, and filter it by genre.</p>
+    </section>
+
+    <section>
+      <h2>Next event</h2>
+      <p>Our events run all winter, from reading circles and story time to poetry nights and a secondhand book fair.</p>
+      <p id="next-event"></p>
+      <p><a href="events.html">See all upcoming events</a></p>
+    </section>
+
+    <section>
+      <h2>Visit us</h2>
+      <p>We are open seven days a week, with late nights on Thursday and Friday. You will find us at 14 Lantern Row, a short walk from the market square and two bus routes.</p>
+      <p><a href="visit.html">Plan your visit</a> for full opening hours, transport options and a contact form.</p>
+    </section>
+  </main>
+
+  <footer class="site-footer">
+    <p>Marginalia Books, 14 Lantern Row, Little Hadley, Eastmarsh LH4 2QD</p>
+    <p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@marginalia.example">hello@marginalia.example</a> or call <a href="tel:+441632960123">01632 960123</a></p>
+    <p>&copy; 2026 Marginalia Books. This is a demo site.</p>
+  </footer>
+
+  <script src="js/books-data.js"></script>
+  <script src="js/events-data.js"></script>
+  <script src="js/dates.js"></script>
+  <script src="js/home.js"></script>
